BAR Droid phone version of BAR's Vote interface (luaui/widgets/gui_vote_interface.lua), the panel an online game's
votes bring up (a team's resign, stop, forcestart): on the screen whole. BAR places it right of the top bar's middle,
under the top bar; upright on a phone the top bar is the screen's right half and the panel a third of the height wide,
so it ran past the right edge: only YES showed, the title, NO and the close button off the screen (dev phone, upright,
a "stop" vote, 2026-11-19). No wider than the screen and moved left until it fits, under the top bar as before. And
its rect for the app's touch widget (WG.BarDroidTapPanels): a tap on it hides the pointer, a drag from it pans.
Applied by the engine (BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as LuaUI loads it; if a block finds no place, BAR's own file
runs.

@@@ find
function widget:Initialize()
	widget:ViewResize()
end
@@@ with
function widget:Initialize()
	widget:ViewResize()
	-- BAR Droid (phone): the panel for the app's touch widget (WG.BarDroidTapPanels): a tap on YES or NO hides the pointer
	-- as on the interface, a drag from it pans as on the map (it answers no IsAbove)
	WG.BarDroidTapPanels = WG.BarDroidTapPanels or {}
	WG.BarDroidTapPanels.vote = function()
		if voteDlist and windowArea then
			return windowArea[1], windowArea[2], windowArea[3], windowArea[4]
		end
	end
end
@@@ end

@@@ find
function widget:Shutdown()
	CloseVote()
end
@@@ with
function widget:Shutdown()
	CloseVote()
	if WG.BarDroidTapPanels then -- BAR Droid (phone): the panel no longer the touch widget's
		WG.BarDroidTapPanels.vote = nil
	end
end
@@@ end

@@@ find
